              <a class="vj-marca" href="https://www.brunellocucinelli.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow" data-lujo="brunello_cucinelli">Brunello Cucinelli <span>abrir ↗</span></a>
            </div>
            <div class="vj-check">
